                <target>Printed at the foot of every invoice: registration numbers, VAT number, or the exemption that applies to you. You are the only one who knows your own situation.</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="u.REqA6">
                <source>description.shop_invoice_prefix</source>
                <target>The letters before the year and the rank, e.g. FA for FA2026-0001. The number is drawn when the order is paid and is never drawn twice.</target>
            </trans-unit>
